# dashboard/.vercelignore — Vercel reads this only when Root Directory = dashboard/
# (W7 fix, Plan 02-06 revision 2026-05-12). Repo-root .vercelignore would be ignored.
# Python code at repo root is automatically excluded by Vercel's Root Directory setting,
# so this file only needs to scrub artifacts within the dashboard/ subtree.
.next/
node_modules/
.vercel/
*.log
.env.local
.pnpm-store/
